{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0144_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "ce21cfe71ae8fdf2ea2aa5f7bce0155890ac11b99413efc896bb39601f52005b", "ja": "だから、自撮りも……\nいっぱい、したの。", "zh": "所以，也拍了好多自拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0144_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6257126ad3862afb8a9505c1a12bbd7cc697813e2b917e1f86b80db0f639457a", "ja": "えっ、杏奈が自撮りを？\n……ああ、アイドルスイッチがオンになったのか？", "zh": "诶，杏奈自拍了？\n……啊，难道是偶像开关打开了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0144_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "689b51bfabb417e2aaaf8e1e43ebfd43733995ee52ed5a3270162e3b93424710", "ja": "ううん、オフのまま……。ネトゲの衣装で\n再現、したくて……。いい、ですか？", "zh": "不是，还是关着的状态……。我想用网游里的服装\n还原一下……。可、以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0144_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c39044b8015c71b5f70c1ba15be0fc51eb63733cdcdb6533846fda6b803cb95c", "ja": "そんなに気に入ってくれたのか……。公開した後なら\n別にいいけど、杏奈本人だってバレないようにな？", "zh": "你这么喜欢啊……公开之后倒是没关系，不过可别让人发现是杏奈本人哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
