{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0144_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "42e9afdb4f05d99b64fe8d56c615dd5b9bfc2f44ac2b0f9b4cf9f8881d64f87d", "ja": "わからない、けど……。お仕事でも、\nみんなでパーティーするの……楽しみ……。", "zh": "不知道，不过……就算是工作，\n能和大家一起开派对……也很期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
